  "title": {
   "en": "Guide-yaku no Tenshi wo Naguritaoshitara, Shiryou Jutsushi ni Narimashita ~Gekikawa Goth Loli Majin-sama, Saikou!~"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "ガイド役の天使を殴り倒したら、死霊術師になりました　～激カワゴスロリ魔神様、サイコー！～"
   },
   {
    "en": "After I Knocked Down a Guide Angel, I Became a Necromancer ~The Supremely Cute Gothic Lolita Evil God is so Terrific!~"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "After starting the super-high-quality VRMMO “Meltis Online”, Rindou Amane (Rinne) got so annoyed at the guiding angel that she beat her up. Deadlocked? Just when she thought so, an extremely cute gothic lolita evil goddess descended and offered her the hidden profession of “Necromancer”! With a pile of corpses left behind in her wake and servants in tow, she's off to conquer the game as fast as she can! Let the ultra-speed overpowered VRMMO tale begin!"
  },
